<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53380" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κάρνειος</span></b> , ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάρνος</span>) title of Apollo in Peloponnesus, <i><span class="en">
			Pi.
			<u>P.</u>
			5.80
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Call.
			<u>Ap.</u>
			71
		</span></i>, etc.:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κάρνεια</span></b> , τά, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κάρνεα</span> metri gr., <i><span class="en">
			Theoc.
			5.83
		</span></i>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>festival held in his
				honour</i> by Dorians, esp. by the Spartans, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
			</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				7.206
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				5.75
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				735.25
			</span></i> (Argos, <span class="entity">i B.C.</span>), etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ Κ. νικᾶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					14.635e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πανηγυρίζειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.873e
				</span></i>
			:—<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κάρνειος</span></b> 
			or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Καρνήϊος</span></b> , ὁ (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήν</span>), name of month in which the festival was held,
				<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				449
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				5.54
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				4.1485
			</span></i> (Epid.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>GDI</u>
				5009
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Crete</span>), etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κάρνειαι θυσίαι</span> at Argos, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				4.620
			</span></i>.</div>
